OL,3,A'Misleading' student loans information
OL,4,Aleft out examples of higher-salary
OL,5,Arepayments
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe also said the Department for
OL,8,FEducation (DfE) must include
OL,9,Fhigher-salary examples on its own
OL,10,Fwebsite, too.
OL,12,FThe DfE said it would review the
OL,13,Finformation it provides, while
OL,14,Funiversities said their websites
OL,15,Freferred to government information and
OL,16,Fwould be reviewed where necessary.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
